  "layout_note": "Completion of Psalm 150 (the final doxology) — sibling of p265 which holds Ps149 tail + Ps150:1-2. This page: Ps150 vv.3-6 body (roman, real w) with interleaved lettered annotations e-i (ITALIC, vv-face) and right-margin verse numbers 3-6 + '†' verse markers; then the large 'ANNOTATIONS. PSALME CL.' commentary block (roman, real w, with left-margin keys) closing with the Gloria Patri (roman display). THREE faces on the page — roman body = real w; roman commentary = real w (with one stray 'vvhole' where the compositor ran short of w-sorts); italic lettered notes + the bracketed '[in eternitie vvithout end]' = vv. Digitization marks excluded (red papal-keys shield; www.fatimamovement.com watermark).",
  "book_title": [],
